# Commit message generation (Source Control sparkle button)
# Newer `.cursor/rules` files are not applied to this flow; keep instructions here.

When generating a Git commit message for this repository:
- Write the entire message in Simplified Chinese (简体中文). Do not use English for the subject or body.
- Follow Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <subject>`
- type: feat / fix / docs / style / refactor / perf / chore
- scope: module name such as agent / workflow / playground / offline
- subject: concise Chinese summary of why the change exists, not a file list
- Keep it to one subject line (about 50 characters). Add a short Chinese body only when the change is non-obvious.

Examples:
feat(agent): 新增 Agent 列表页面，遵循 DESIGN.md 的 Notion 风格
fix(request): 修复 401 重复跳转问题
docs(design): 更新 DESIGN.md 的颜色 token
